mission "The Cormorant Convoy"
    name "The Cormorant Convoy"
    description "Sail to Cormorant Bank, sink the three gunboats, then return to Mariner's Rest to meet the freed convoy masters."
    source "San Telmo"
    destination "Mariner's Rest"
    reward 680
    objective kills 3
    battlefield "Cormorant Bank" 9800 6600
    enemy "Cormorant Bank Guard 1"
    enemy "Cormorant Bank Guard 2"
    enemy "Cormorant Bank Guard 3"
    speaker offer "Captain Ines Calderon"
    speaker visit "Captain Ines Calderon"
    speaker complete "Captain Ines Calderon"
    to offer
        has "The Soundings of San Telmo: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `Three Company gunboats are escorting a captured convoy through Cormorant Bank.`
            `The convoy carries grain, medicine, and sailcloth for smaller islands. The Company plans to auction the cargo after declaring the ships abandoned.`
            `The gunboats are larger than the cutters in the Windward Reach. They sail in a loose line and protect one another with overlapping broadsides.`
            choice
                `(I will take this voyage. Tell me the course.)`
                    goto accept_job
                `(What makes this business so important?)`
                    goto more_details
                `(I have other waters to sail.)`
                    goto decline_job
            label more_details
                `The gunboats are larger than the cutters in the Windward Reach. They sail in a loose line and protect one another with overlapping broadsides.`
                choice
                    `(Then I will see it done.)`
                        goto accept_job
                    `(Not this time.)`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `Calderon marks the bank on your chart. “The channel is broad enough to manoeuvre, but do not let them cross your stern together.”`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `The officer nods and rolls the chart closed. The offer will remain here if you change your mind.`
                close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The Cormorant Convoy. Sail to Cormorant Bank, sink the three gunboats, then return to Mariner's Rest to meet the freed convoy masters."
    on visit
        conversation
            `The convoy masters thank you and offer their cargo records. The manifests show that Company agents have been moving powder and chain to Puerto Cielo.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `The next target is a fortified storehouse in the high harbour of Puerto Cielo.`
        log "Completed The Cormorant Convoy. Received 680 gold. The next target is a fortified storehouse in the high harbour of Puerto Cielo."
